{
    "word": "unflappable",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "fa29b400-a601-3cec-bf94-e95cfbda917b",
                "word": "unflappable",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "fee9ae42-34bf-4ad5-9c30-bd359d064e7a",
                        "entry_id": "fa29b400-a601-3cec-bf94-e95cfbda917b",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more unflappable"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "341f27fe-f958-4aae-8934-e86c1453fc77",
                        "entry_id": "fa29b400-a601-3cec-bf94-e95cfbda917b",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most unflappable"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81ae6315-cfed-3624-86c4-f5099856d946",
                        "entry_id": "fa29b400-a601-3cec-bf94-e95cfbda917b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Remaining composed and level-headed at all times; impossible to fluster; not becoming frustrated or irritated easily."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7162a060-d397-4bee-85f8-d3a5c15c2455",
                                "sense_id": "81ae6315-cfed-3624-86c4-f5099856d946",
                                "text": "It was for this reason that when Lord Hailsham first described Harold Macmillan as \"unflappable'\", it became an instant catchword, distancing the incoming Prime Minister from his predecessor"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2946096-b9a2-4295-ae08-ff6d2abc7397",
                                "sense_id": "81ae6315-cfed-3624-86c4-f5099856d946",
                                "text": "The whole thing looked remarkably like an implacable force meeting an unflappable object."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "19c84d30-bff9-439e-a82c-05cfb5194711",
                                "sense_id": "81ae6315-cfed-3624-86c4-f5099856d946",
                                "text": "Whereas his predecessor was impetuous, Obama was praised for being contemplative and unflappable. Bush had a gut; Obama had a brain."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9f816f0-53c3-4d06-b178-ae0a06f322ff",
                                "sense_id": "81ae6315-cfed-3624-86c4-f5099856d946",
                                "text": "It took a lot to get Wheeler's pulse going, but Lillian's dangerous joke had done the job. The otherwise unflappable woman was flushed with adrenaline."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f3c141db-87e3-4640-9d60-739f53724179",
                        "source_entry_id": "fa29b400-a601-3cec-bf94-e95cfbda917b",
                        "source_sense_id": "81ae6315-cfed-3624-86c4-f5099856d946",
                        "source_sense_description": "remaining composed and level-headed at all times",
                        "target_lang_word": "onverstoorbaar",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "onverstoorbaar",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3189ec94-0ce7-3b6b-9733-51899261106a",
                                        "entry_id": "09c1c0cf-6193-3c61-b7a9-45bf2686e48a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zonder de aandacht te verliezen, moeilijk van zijn stuk te brengen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e957782-8bd1-4e61-aca3-a7305f2b172d",
                                                "sense_id": "3189ec94-0ce7-3b6b-9733-51899261106a",
                                                "text": "Hij heeft een vrij onverstoorbare manier van doen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "331aff8d-9a16-4049-acda-b3afd4dd2d58",
                                                "sense_id": "3189ec94-0ce7-3b6b-9733-51899261106a",
                                                "text": "Ik vroeg haar wat ze van mijn plan vond om een tijdje niet te spreken. ‘Gewoon doen. Waarom niet?’ Hierna wenste ze me happy trails en liep onverstoorbaar door naar boven."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6ffa5a5-053d-4b8f-9e39-14a4ce428b02",
                                                "sense_id": "3189ec94-0ce7-3b6b-9733-51899261106a",
                                                "text": "Het gedreun van de heimachine was in zijn hele lichaam te voelen, een vertrouwenwekkend kloppen binnen in hem. Zo ging het werk vooruit, langzaam en onverstoorbaar."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "onverstoorbaar",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57197c0a-a371-390b-bb44-f9dd5dadb7f0",
                                        "entry_id": "072c40f5-c485-356d-bd24-8d4731666d2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "op onverstoorbare wijze"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e553332-862e-4820-9365-ff9496047f27",
                                                "sense_id": "57197c0a-a371-390b-bb44-f9dd5dadb7f0",
                                                "text": "Hij zat onverstoorbaar te lezen toen de kast omviel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a57c66f-5a97-4d69-b741-6389fbd9578e",
                        "source_entry_id": "fa29b400-a601-3cec-bf94-e95cfbda917b",
                        "source_sense_id": "81ae6315-cfed-3624-86c4-f5099856d946",
                        "source_sense_description": "remaining composed and level-headed at all times",
                        "target_lang_word": "imperturbable",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "imperturbable",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "267392ca-c648-39a0-b3b6-1deb92b87ced",
                                        "entry_id": "fc8fa9b7-baf0-3f71-91b6-6338331d3e16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que rien ne peut troubler, ébranler ou émouvoir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec7cc95e-27fe-4434-bc1a-8bc2317ae0ad",
                                                "sense_id": "267392ca-c648-39a0-b3b6-1deb92b87ced",
                                                "text": "C'était un gros garçon, artiste peintre au moins médiocre, à vue très-courte, moralement s'entend, qui ne doutait de rien et parlait de tout avec un aplomb imperturbable. Il prétendait avoir une grande instruction; mais il est à croire qu’il l’avait reçue sous le sceau de la confession, car il ne révélait jamais rien. Emile Mathieu, L’esprit de famille, Paris : Librairie Hachette & Cie, 1863, p. 114"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df73e38e-5b74-436f-9311-aa82f2c2b06b",
                                                "sense_id": "267392ca-c648-39a0-b3b6-1deb92b87ced",
                                                "text": "Le navire imperturbable cingle vers l'immensité polaire, se glisse parmi les icebergs fantastiques qui dérivent en tournoyant cauteleusement, évités de justesse, en vain menaçants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ddad356-5616-47fd-aa6c-c468f652c04b",
                                                "sense_id": "267392ca-c648-39a0-b3b6-1deb92b87ced",
                                                "text": "Les vrais amis sont comme les arbres\nIls ont hâte de te voir\nMais restent imperturbables\nSi tu ne passes pas dire bonsoir »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "442e5212-b342-4f3c-975a-b2ffa9561e07",
                        "source_entry_id": "fa29b400-a601-3cec-bf94-e95cfbda917b",
                        "source_sense_id": "81ae6315-cfed-3624-86c4-f5099856d946",
                        "source_sense_description": "remaining composed and level-headed at all times",
                        "target_lang_word": "unerschütterlich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unerschütterlich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "981e454f-aeaf-3976-89e9-936c3bdfc7cb",
                                        "entry_id": "4852bb70-54f4-3f91-a195-91c00667f983",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "durch nichts zu erschüttern"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8619178-0ec5-41c5-8d5f-f998f85360c2",
                                                "sense_id": "981e454f-aeaf-3976-89e9-936c3bdfc7cb",
                                                "text": "Sein Selbstvertrauen ist unerschütterlich."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4ccacfe-15bb-4801-adf8-4e959b8ed6ff",
                                                "sense_id": "981e454f-aeaf-3976-89e9-936c3bdfc7cb",
                                                "text": "„Er erzählte mit unerschütterlicher Sicherheit unglaubliche Dinge; man mußte sich so stellen, als glaube man sie, denn er war stets Augenzeuge gewesen oder war selber der Held der Geschichte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
